{"id":"bonus","lemma":"Bonus","pos":"noun","rank":4966,"glosses":["bonus (premium or advantage)","rebate"],"ipa":"/ˈboːnʊs/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e6/De-Bonus.ogg/De-Bonus.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Bonus","plural":"Bonusse"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich bekam meinen Bonus.","en":"I received my bonus.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/745315","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to receive","l":"bekommen"},{"g":"to opine, to think"},null]},{"text":"Ich war enttäuscht, als ich sah, dass mein Bonus etwas niedriger war, als ich erwartet hatte.","en":"I was disappointed to see that my bonus was a bit less than I was expecting.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"disappointed"},{"g":"at the same moment"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to see","l":"sehen"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"something"},{"g":"low","l":"niedrig"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"at the same moment"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"expected, anticipated"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"}]},{"text":"Ich verpulverte meinen gesamten Bonus mit Einkäufen und Reisen.","en":"I blew my whole bonus on shopping and travel.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"to opine, to think"},{"g":"total","l":"gesamt"},null,{"g":"with"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"to travel"}]}]}